2. **mem_085 (Inductive Bias-Physical Determinant Matching)**: Revises the understanding of hypothesis selection based on RE-PerioGT evidence. Proposes a new hypothesis: match the sophistication of the learning mechanism to the complexity of the physical determinant. Computable determinants → feature engineering; non-computable invariances → contrastive learning.

3. **mem_086 (Experimental Methodology)**: Documents the validated incremental development methodology, contrasting HEPT's failure (multiple untested components) with RE-PerioGT's clarity (one component, proper ablation). The feature-only ablation saved 286 minutes of compute time by revealing contrastive learning was unnecessary.

