- Y4: Targeted feature engineering reduces epistemic uncertainty by >15%

---

**Why NOT Equivariant Architecture Idea:**
- Tg/Tm/Egc are scalar properties without direct angular dependencies
- Miller et al. shows equivariance benefits geometric tensor properties (dipole, spatial extent)
- For polymer chain properties: periodicity > equivariance > depth
