pre-training data.

Proposed: 32.31 K IS the realistic ceiling for Tg prediction WITHOUT curated pre-training 
data. The 30.8 K SOTA (PerioGT 2025) requires curated PI1M subset with validated distribution 
coverage - it is unrealistic to achieve without special resources.

